                            <comment id="16748682" author="pavlukhin" created="Tue, 22 Jan 2019 12:43:56 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt; could you double check that ticket is relevant? Test contains code:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
checkPutGet(ignite.cache(TX_CACHE), ignite.transactions(), OPTIMISTIC, REPEATABLE_READ);
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;and it is not surprise that it fails in &lt;tt&gt;FORCE_MVCC&lt;/tt&gt; mode.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16748706" author="amashenkov" created="Tue, 22 Jan 2019 13:12:19 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;There is no need to run test in ForceMvcc mode. This should be fixed.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The original issue was that checkPutGet(ignite.cache(TX_CACHE)...) always failed if it had called right after&#160;checkPutGet(ignite.cache(MVCC_CACHE),...)&lt;br/&gt;
Seems, it has already been fixed within some another ticket.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16748799" author="pavlukhin" created="Tue, 22 Jan 2019 14:55:00 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=amashenkov&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;amashenkov&quot;&gt;amashenkov&lt;/a&gt; Could you please take a look at the patch? I disabled the mentioned test in forced MVCC mode.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16748848" author="amashenkov" created="Tue, 22 Jan 2019 15:46:27 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/ViewProfile.jspa?name=Pavlukhin&quot; class=&quot;user-hover&quot; rel=&quot;Pavlukhin&quot;&gt;Pavlukhin&lt;/a&gt;,&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Look ok. Thanks.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="16751087" author="pavlukhin" created="Thu, 24 Jan 2019 12:52:50 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;No visa here because patch does not introduce any changes but excludes a particular test from execution with forced MVCC mode.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
